<title>USA: TABLE - K2 Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - K2 Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands except for per share figures)</p>
<p>				 Second Quarter		 Six Months</p>
<p>				 ended June 30	     ended June 30</p>
<p>			    1997	  1996	  1997	  1996</p>
<p>Net Sales	  $ 171,522   $ 143,373   $ 343,063   $ 302,226</p>
